    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Rattus hydra.</em> A many-headed rat-hydra that inflates its neck pouch into a toxic balloon — hovering, shrugging off blows, and blasting foes away with pressurised wind until someone punctures it. Habitat: Forest &amp; Hill.</p><p><em>Source: Heliana's Field Notes X-51 (Loot Tavern)</em></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
