      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>While the hydrat's neck pouch is inflated, it can hover, and has Resistance to Bludgeoning, Cold, Fire, and Slashing damage. If the hydrat takes 20+ Piercing damage on a single turn while inflated, it deflates with a burst of toxic gas and falls Prone. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 16 Constitution, each creature within 15 feet of the hydrat when it deflates. <em>Failure:</em> 18 (4d8) Poison damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
